From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:31:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] iommu/arm-smmu-qcom: Kaanapali MDSS ACTLR behind a
 switch

qcom_smmu_actlr_client_of_match sets the ACTLR of the SM8750 display
controller (default prefetch, CMTLB context caching) but has no entry
for the Kaanapali one, whose context bank keeps the reset value. That
may cost TLB misses on scanout at 3392x2400 (inferred, not measured).

Add the entry behind arm_smmu.kaanapali_mdss_actlr (read-only, default
off): 1 writes PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB for "qcom,kaanapali-mdss" as for
"qcom,sm8750-mdss"; 0 finds no match for it, as before. It touches the
display path, so it is meant for an A/B with the glitch detector and the
underrun counters first.

Own idea (21 Nov gains scan, gfx-media).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
index e20d274bc5fd5..9880be56969f4 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/arm/arm-smmu/arm-smmu-qcom.c
@@ -349,12 +349,32 @@ static bool qcom_adreno_can_do_ttbr1(struct arm_smmu_device *smmu)
 	return true;
 }
 
+/*
+ * The Kaanapali display controller with the ACTLR value of its SM8750
+ * predecessor (default prefetch, context-match TLB caching). Opt-in until it
+ * is measured (underruns, glitch detector): arm_smmu.kaanapali_mdss_actlr=1;
+ * 0 (default) leaves its ACTLR as before.
+ */
+static bool kaanapali_mdss_actlr;
+module_param(kaanapali_mdss_actlr, bool, 0444);
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(kaanapali_mdss_actlr,
+		 "Kaanapali MDSS: SMMU ACTLR default prefetch + CMTLB as on SM8750 (default off)");
+
+static const struct of_device_id qcom_smmu_actlr_kaanapali_mdss[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,kaanapali-mdss",
+			.data = (const void *) (PREFETCH_DEFAULT | CMTLB) },
+	{ }
+};
+
 static void qcom_smmu_set_actlr_dev(struct device *dev, struct arm_smmu_device *smmu, int cbndx,
 		const struct of_device_id *client_match)
 {
 	const struct of_device_id *match =
 			of_match_device(client_match, dev);
 
+	if (!match && kaanapali_mdss_actlr)
+		match = of_match_device(qcom_smmu_actlr_kaanapali_mdss, dev);
+
 	if (!match) {
 		dev_dbg(dev, "no ACTLR settings present\n");
 		return;
-- 
